<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>技能精灵总画廊（优化版）</title>
<script src="../../fanvas3-transparent.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin:0; background:#101015; color:#ddd; font-family: system-ui, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; }
  header { position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50; background:#1b1b24; border-bottom:1px solid #333;
           padding:10px 14px; display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  header h1 { font-size:16px; margin:0; color:#9cf; white-space:nowrap; }
  #count { color:#7c7; font-size:13px; white-space:nowrap; }
  #filter { flex:1; min-width:160px; padding:7px 10px; background:#111; color:#eee; border:1px solid #555; border-radius:5px; }
  .hint { font-size:12px; color:#f99; }
  #grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap:10px; padding:10px; }
  .card { background:#1a1a22; border:1px solid #2e2e3a; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; position:relative; cursor:pointer; }
  .card .stage { width:100%; height:170px; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
                 background:repeating-conic-gradient(#222 0% 25%, #1b1b22 0% 50%) 50%/24px 24px; }
  .card .stage canvas { position:absolute; display:block; }
  .card .cap { padding:4px 6px; font-size:11px; color:#9cf; text-align:center; background:#181820; }
  .card.loading .stage::after { content:"…"; position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#555; font-size:24px; }
  .card:hover { border-color:#6cf; }
  /* ── 锚点标记（与角色模型总画廊同源）── */
  .mk-origin { position:absolute; width:20px; height:20px; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); pointer-events:none; z-index:6;
    background:
      linear-gradient(#ff3b3b,#ff3b3b) center/2px 100% no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#ff3b3b,#ff3b3b) center/100% 2px no-repeat; }
  .mk-foot { position:absolute; width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:50%; background:#ffd400;
             transform:translate(-50%,-50%); pointer-events:none; z-index:7; box-shadow:0 0 3px #000; }
  .mk-label { position:absolute; left:3px; bottom:3px; font-size:10px; line-height:1.2; color:#ffd9d9;
              pointer-events:none; z-index:7; text-shadow:0 0 3px #000,0 0 3px #000; white-space:nowrap; }
  /* ── 详情弹层（点击放大 + 水平翻转）── */
  #modal { position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:100; background:rgba(0,0,0,.78); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  #modal.hidden { display:none; }
  .mw { background:#17171f; border:1px solid #3a3a48; border-radius:10px; max-width:min(94vw,900px); max-height:92vh; overflow:auto; }
  .mh { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:10px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #2e2e3a; position:sticky; top:0; background:#17171f; }
  .mh .t { font-size:15px; color:#9cf; }
  .mh .x { margin-left:auto; }
  .mb { display:flex; gap:14px; padding:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  #mstage { width:360px; height:360px; position:relative; flex:0 0 auto;
            background:repeating-conic-gradient(#222 0% 25%, #1b1b22 0% 50%) 50%/28px 28px; border:1px solid #333; overflow:hidden; }
  #mstage canvas { position:absolute; display:block; }
  .mlabels { flex:1 1 260px; min-width:240px; }
  .mdir { margin-bottom:8px; display:flex; gap:6px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .mdir span { font-size:12px; color:#888; }
  .mlabels button { padding:4px 8px; font-size:12px; background:#2c2c38; color:#cde; border:1px solid #444; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer; }
  .mlabels button:hover { background:#3d4c5c; }
  .mlabels button.on { background:#1d6fa5; color:#fff; border-color:#6cf; }
  .mtip { font-size:11px; color:#888; margin:8px 0 4px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>技能精灵总画廊</h1>
  <span id="count"></span>
  <input id="filter" placeholder="筛选技能 ID（如 10001）…">
  <button id="toggle" style="padding:6px 12px;background:#2196F3;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer">暂停全部</button>
</header>
<div style="padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#bbb;background:#181820;border-bottom:1px solid #2a2a34">
  运行：在 GameWorld 目录起服务 → <code>cd D:\tsqt\主程序\GameWorld</code> 后 <code>python -m http.server 8000</code> → 打开本页（进入视口即自动播放，离开即销毁；可一键暂停全部）。
  <span style="color:#ff8a8a">红十字 = 锚点(Flash 原点 (0,0))</span> ·
  <span style="color:#ffd400">黄点 = 同一锚点</span>：精灵在游戏中被 pin 到落点/目标的那一点（与技能/特效「原点对齐落点」同源）。
  <b>点击任意卡片可放大查看，放大层支持水平翻转（LB / RT 为镜像）。</b>
</div>
<div id="grid"></div>

<div id="modal" class="hidden">
  <div class="mw">
    <div class="mh">
      <span class="t" id="mtitle">—</span>
      <button class="x gray" id="mclose">关闭 ✕</button>
    </div>
    <div class="mb">
      <div id="mstage"></div>
      <div class="mlabels">
        <div class="mdir">
          <span>朝向：</span>
          <button data-d="RB" class="on">RB</button><button data-d="LB">LB(镜像)</button>
          <button data-d="LT">LT</button><button data-d="RT">RT(镜像)</button>
        </div>
        <div class="mtip">精灵锚点（红十字 = Flash 原点 (0,0)，与技能/特效落点同源）。LB / RT = 水平翻转。</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
